HISTORY :
---------

        V1.0    Only for my BBS :) !

        V1.1    First public release !

        V2.0    The ultimate major update !
                - Three different DisplayModes...
                - Can show deleted files in another color...
                - Shows lots of additional informations !
                - Fully configurable (config-file, conf-text, colors, etc.) !

        V2.1    Small changes :
                - Bigger Internal Buffer
                - Faster Output (yep, this is possible !)
                - Detects no longer dates in the description,
                  which caused blank filenames in the list !
                - Added registration info, hehe !
                
        V2.2    Modified by REbEL/QTX in 2019:
                - Added date range parameter
                - Added @D keyword
                - Removed registration info, hehe !
                - Also included disassembled source.

